error[R0202]: `entry` is checked for nil after it was already indexed
--> 10:9: nil check here
    9:18: `entry` is indexed here — throws if it is nil
  = note: every path from the last assignment of `entry` to this check reaches the use first, so if `entry` can be nil the use throws and this check never runs
  = help: move the check above the first use, or drop it if `entry` cannot be nil
